// The stalling contract the bridge's ending and admission walks hold open.
// hold is abstract, and the body the walk supplies polls the cancel flag and
// returns only once a cancel request reaches it, so a Break, a dropped
// stream, or a server stopping beside a hold in flight all have to ask the
// body to stop before they wait for it. ping answers at once, the unary call
// a full server must still have a worker for.

contract Stall [version: 1] {
    pledge hold() -> Result<Bool, Int>

    pledge ping() -> Result<Bool, Int> {
        return Ok(true)
    }
}
